  "Name": "ADJUSTTOQTY-CLRV7WithAsktoPost",
  "Description": "ADJUST TO QTY (CLRv7 and AsktoPost)\n\nUser can enter the Qty of the Trackingentity to adjust to, without entering the Increase or Decrease and without working out the amount.\nUser can also specify if ERP adjust is required.\n\nThe process is a custom process -uses CLR to perform the adjustment.\nThere is a step asking if the post to ERP is required, and this is taken into Account in the POST Step201\nThis process adds a STEP 201 to use the CLR POST as well.  It still looks at the Integration_Transactions View to pick up the last transaction (just entered).  It uses a DATEDIFF to check that the Transaction was in the last 60 seconds.",
